# Project Structure

All Roblox projects must follow this structure.

ReplicatedStorage
  Systems
  Config
  Shared

ServerScriptService
  Systems
  Boot

StarterPlayer
  StarterPlayerScripts
    ClientSystems

StarterGui
  Screens
  UIControllers

Guidelines:

Systems → gameplay logic  
UIControllers → UI logic only  
Config → game data and configuration  
Shared → utilities used by multiple systems

Never place gameplay logic inside UI scripts.